{
  "name": "sequence-edges",
  "description": "S7 edges. Any mode that is not `join` is a replace. A join with nothing mounted mounts page 0. A page without components is mounted without a root. A replace only removes keys under `K:` or `K#<digits>:`: a host key that merely starts with the sub-page key, or with `K#` and no number before the colon, stays.",
